&lt;li&gt;Frame ambiguous problems cleanly and guide others through structured analysis to evidence-backed answers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Question whether the stated problem is the right one, and reframe it when it is not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build evidence-backed propositions and strategic directions, drawing on cultural and industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
