&lt;h4&gt;Personal Buying experience&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior UX Researcher&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior UX Researcher (IC3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Lille&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timing: ASAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport and make wellbeing accessible for all. To make this mission a reality, Decathlon relies on In-Store teammates who embody the human touchpoint between our brand and our customers, and are key enablers of Store business. This is exactly where your mission comes in: unlocking a deep understanding of our in-store teammates to identify key pain points and turn them into clear business opportunities. Working in a dynamic omnichannel context, you will partner closely with product teams to guide the creation of simple, efficient, and field-adapted experiences—enabling our teammates to be as impactful as possible with our customers while bridging the gap between user needs, business goals, and technological opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital plays a pivotal role in the quality of the connection built during moments shared between customers and teammates. How? By ensuring every In-Store Decathlonian works in an efficient and adapted environment that seamlessly supports their daily tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;UX Researcher&lt;/strong&gt; to dive into In-Store behaviors and elevate the &lt;strong&gt;Personal Buying Experience&lt;/strong&gt;. Your mission will be to uncover the needs and friction points of our teammates on the floor, identify and build strong opportunities, while supporting our product team in their craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;User Researcher&lt;/strong&gt;, you will enrich our &lt;strong&gt;User Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; and drive the tangible impact of your findings on our in-store tools. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decode the field:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct in-store observations to map the real-world practices, workflows, and pain points of our store teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide decision-making:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn qualitative and quantitative data into actionable strategic insights to shape the product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promote a User-first culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Feed our team&#39;s knowledge repository to align Designers, Product Managers, and Tech leads with the reality on the shop floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer / Researcher, you will act as a &lt;strong&gt;key partner with cross-functional product teams&lt;/strong&gt; to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;influence and enlighten decisions&lt;/strong&gt;, whether long-term strategy, quarterly roadmaps or day-to-day tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build a &lt;strong&gt;shared understanding / empathy&lt;/strong&gt; of the current customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ensure that we identify and tackle &lt;strong&gt;the most relevant opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;build long-term impact&lt;/strong&gt; (outcomes) rather than features (outputs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build and feed a long term &lt;strong&gt;user and customer knowledge strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft / Core skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Framing -&lt;/strong&gt; Support product decisions (product outcomes, opportunities, solutions) through research insights and Opportunity Solution Trees (OSTs) / Identify and prioritize research plans with stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
