&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3705&quot; data-local-id=&quot;08931f048a7e&quot;&gt;Partner with GPU kernel engineers and platform engineers to diagnose bottlenecks across model code, kernels, runtime, scheduler, gateway, and cluster layers.&lt;/p&gt;
